# Example skill

Skills are reusable instructions the agent can load on demand. Each skill is a
directory under `skills/` containing a `SKILL.md` file: the frontmatter `name`
and `description` are shown to the agent for discovery; this body is injected
into its context when the skill is loaded.

Write procedures here as you would brief a capable colleague: the steps to
follow, the commands to run, and the pitfalls to avoid.
